sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant Kernel
    participant Disk
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over App,Disk: Synchronous I/O (Blocking)
        App->>Kernel: read(fd, buf, size)
        Note over App: Process blocks
        Kernel->>Disk: Issue read
        Disk-->>Kernel: Data ready
        Kernel-->>App: Return data
        Note over App: Process continues
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over App,Disk: Asynchronous I/O (io_uring)
        App->>Kernel: io_uring_submit() - read request
        Note over App: Process continues immediately
        App->>App: Do other work
        Kernel->>Disk: Issue read
        Disk-->>Kernel: Data ready
        Kernel->>Kernel: Complete request
        App->>Kernel: io_uring_wait() - check completion
        Kernel-->>App: Data ready
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        Note over App,Disk: Non-Blocking I/O
        App->>Kernel: read(O_NONBLOCK)
        Kernel-->>App: EAGAIN (not ready)
        App->>App: Do other work
        App->>Kernel: read(O_NONBLOCK)
        Kernel-->>App: Data returned
    end
